{
  "_comment": [
    "Multi-model plain-harness (VeruSAGE-Bench) config for 8x B200 cluster.",
    "Models, sources, and vllm_extra_args mirror VerifyThisBench_iclr/scripts/configs/full_run.json.",
    "max_token / max_model_context are auto-derived from --max-model-len in vllm_extra_args.",
    "action_max_tokens is 8192 for max_model_len == 32768, else 81920."
